# The sdist carries what builds the wheel: src/, pyproject.toml, README.md, LICENSE and NOTICE. The test suite needs
# the whole repository (its data and helpers, bench/, tools/, the workflows, the Dockerfile and the Compose files), so
# setuptools' default of shipping tests/test_*.py alone, without any of that, would ship tests that cannot run. Run the
# tests from a clone or the source archive instead.
prune tests
